                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amulange Abrahamu usowanu a-Sara iwakamuzyala, nkaambo naakacili muntu omwe buyo, ndakamwiita, ndakamupa coolwe, aboobo wakaba bantu banjibanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.2",
