        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Jehova uyooumbulizya Zioni. Uyooumbulizya matongo aakwe oonse; inkanda yakwe uyooisandula kuti ibe mbuli Edeni, amabbuwa aakwe ayooba mbuli muunda wa-Jehova. Mumonya omo muyoojanwa kukondwa akusekelela, kulumba amajwi aakutembaula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
