                  "text": "2 Pet 3:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amulanzye meso aanu kujulu, ayalo nyika yaansi amwiibonesye, nkaambo ijulu liyoomwaika mbuli busi, nyika iyoocekula mbuli cikobela, abaabo bakede mulinjiyo bayoofwa mbuli busususuli, pele lufutuko lwangu ndwalyoonse, abululami bwangu tabukooyoomana pe.",
          "type": "text",
