              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mapempya ayoobalya mbubonya mbuli cikobela mbuciligwa, atumvunyu tuyoobalya mbuli boya bwambelele. Pele bululami bwangu buyooba bwalyoonse, alufutuko lwangu luyoobedelela mumazyalani oonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.8",
