        },
        {
          "text": "Bana bako bawizuka, balilede kumagolelo aamigwagwa yoonse mbuli lweengu uucedwe. Balizwide bukali bwa-Jehova alutapatilo lwa-Leza wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
