          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami wako Jehova, Leza wako uubeteka makani aabantu bakwe, Bona! Ndagwisya mujanza lyako inkomeki iidadalisya, amutiba wabukali bwakwe tokooyoounywida limbi. ",
